    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points History API provides access to detailed records of loyalty points earned and redeemed by members. This endpoint allows users to retrieve a comprehensive history of transactions related to hotel loyalty programs, including points accrued, used, and their current balance. Typical consumers include hotel members seeking to track their loyalty status and system integrations that require visibility into member loyalty activities. This API is essential for enhancing customer engagement and optimizing loyalty program operations.",
